OL,4,CGerard Depardieu and French author     
OL,5,Cinvestigated over sexual allegations   
OL,6,GFrench authorities are investigating   
OL,7,Gdisgraced actor Gerard Depardieu and   
OL,8,Gthe author Michel Houellebecq over     
OL,9,G"allegations of a sexual nature", a    
OL,10,Gsource with knowledge of the           
OL,11,Ginvestigation says.                    
OL,13,FThe confirmation comes after reports   
OL,14,Fin French media that the two were      
OL,15,Faccused of being involved in a "gang   
OL,16,Frape" on the set of the film Thalasso  
OL,17,Fin 2018 by an actress.                 
